      <h2>About The Rock Restaurant</h2>
      <div>The Rock Restaurant on Michamvi Pingwe beach is an iconic restaurant perched on a coral rock outcrop in the Indian Ocean, accessible by foot at low tide across exposed reef flats, or by boat at high tide. Famous for fresh seafood — grilled lobster, calamari, prawns — caught daily by local fishermen, served with panoramic 360-degree ocean views. The thatched-roof structure blends with the coral rock. Reservations essential; low-tide walk-in access is a unique experience. Combine with Michamvi beach relaxation.</div>
